# {{.Name}} — app runner

Thin runner for `packages/{{.Name}}`: `./cmd/{{.Name}}` for production, `./cmd/{{.Name}}-dev` for development.

## Ports

- App (Go HTTP server): **{{.AppPort}}**, in both runners
- Astro dev server: **{{.AstroPort}}**, in `packages/{{.Name}}/astro.config.mjs`

## Run

```sh
make install    # once: this project's folders and dependencies
make dev        # astro (background) + air hot reload → http://localhost:{{.AppPort}}
make web        # astro dev server only → http://localhost:{{.AstroPort}}
make stop       # stop the background astro server
make check      # checks the formatting, vets and builds the runner
```

## Production

```sh
cd ../../packages/{{.Name}}
pnpm build
cd ../..
go build -o ./apps/{{.Name}}/tmp/{{.Name}} ./apps/{{.Name}}/cmd/{{.Name}}
./apps/{{.Name}}/tmp/{{.Name}}   # → http://localhost:{{.AppPort}}, reads ./config.json
```

